<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Spieker Properties, Corimon.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Spieker Properties, Corimon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday Spieker Properties Inc was not available for after-hours trading due to news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA was also unavailable for trading, it said.</p>
<p>Late on Friday, Spieker said it had sold retail properties and signed definitive contracts to sell six additional retail projects to Pacific Retail Trust for a total of $106.5 million.</p>
